    {
      "id": 13571,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "description": "<h1>Changelog</h1>\n<h2>2.0.0 — SPT 4.0 rewrite</h2>\n<p>Full C# port of the TypeScript mod. Targets SPT <code>~4.0.0</code>.</p>\n<h3>Migration from 1.5.0</h3>\n<p><strong>Drop your old <code>config/</code> and <code>MissingQuestWeapons/</code> files in as-is — they will be migrated automatically on first load.</strong> Migrated files are rewritten in the new format and stamped with a <code>version</code> field; the old format is treated as v0.</p>\n<p>What the migrator does:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>config.jsonc</code>: fixes the <code>categorizeWithLessRestrive</code> typo, drops the unused <code>delay</code> field.</li>\n<li><code>OverriddenWeapons.jsonc</code> → <code>WeaponOverrides.jsonc</code>: <code>Override</code> block becomes <code>manualTypeOverrides</code>, <code>CustomCategories</code> becomes <code>customTypeRules</code>.</li>\n<li><code>QuestOverrides.jsonc</code>: structure preserved, version stamped.</li>\n<li>New <code>AttachmentOverrides.jsonc</code> is optional — defaults cover the full attachment tree.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No manual edits required for a stock 1.5.0 install.</p>\n<h3>New</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Attachment-condition expansion (<code>weaponModsInclusive</code> / <code>weaponModsExclusive</code>) — supports mod-added quests with no <code>weapon</code> array.</li>\n<li>Rule-chain type detection — bolt-action / pump-action / revolver / caliber checks are config, not code.</li>\n<li>Per-condition override matching by structural properties, not only condition ID.</li>\n<li>Opt-in <code>bestCandidateExpansion</code> and <code>validateOverrideIds</code>.</li>\n<li>Inspector CLI + local web UI for offline iteration on configs without launching SPT.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Removed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>delay</code> config field (was a no-op).</li>\n<li><code>logType</code> — replaced by always-on file log + SPT console, gated by <code>debug</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1503/add-missing-quest-weapon-requirements/2.0.0",
